# Recommended Risk Treatment Plan

## High-Risk Items

### Ransomware

Recommended Actions:

- Strengthen endpoint protection
- Implement continuous monitoring
- Enforce timely patch management
- Conduct backup testing

### Data Breach

Recommended Actions:

- Expand MFA deployment
- Encrypt sensitive data
- Increase security monitoring
- Improve access reviews

### Insider Threat

Recommended Actions:

- Strengthen role-based access control
- Implement privileged access management
- Increase logging and monitoring

